  <scopecontent id="9b91df0f21e6b797f36a61409eb8ca5f">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>This collection includes family trees documenting the lineage of the Rockefeller family and related branches. A few items are oversized or multi-sheet rolls adhered with tape. In most cases, individual family members are identified using adhesive labels.</p>  </scopecontent>
